Probably the way I worded it wasn't clear - I meant to say, if you had 
only uncursed paper, a blessed magic marker would have been a good 
alternative; if you had blessed paper, an uncursed one is probably 
better. I mentioned the BUC status because usually one wishes for 
blessed items.

This is because blessed markers bless the paper they write on, or 
uncurse cursed paper. This makes writing blessed scrolls easy, but 
cursed ones harder (impossible directly - you have to curse the scroll 
afterwards). Generally an uncursed marker is regarded as better because 
it allows you to write scrolls of all BUC statuses.

