> I'm not sure what you mean... I used the Nethack.exe version

Ah right. You *can* copy text in that version. Open it in a command 
prompt window (rather than full screen) then click on the command prompt 
icon in the top left. Choose Edit->Mark and you can use the mouse to 
select a box of text. Press enter and it copies it to the clipboard. 
Alternatively you can set "QuickEdit Mode" in properties. You can then 
select the text without choosing Mark first.

